#: warehouse/templates/manage/projects.html:132
msgid "Archived Projects"
msgstr "Arkiverade projekt"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/unverified-account.html:4
msgid "Activate your account"
msgstr "Aktivera ditt konto"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/unverified-account.html:216
msgid ""
"You must verify an existing email address and make it your primary email "
"address before making any other changes to your account."
msgstr ""
"Du måste verifiera en befintlig e-postadress och ange den som din primära "
"e-postadress innan du kan göra andra ändringar i kontot."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/unverified-account.html:222
#, python-format
msgid ""
"If you cannot verify any email addresses listed, please see <a "
"href=\"%(help_url)s\">%(help_url)s</a> to recover access to your account."
msgstr ""
"Om du inte kan verifiera någon av e-postadresserna i listan kan du läsa <a "
"href=\"%(help_url)s\">%(help_url)s</a> för att återfå åtkomsten till kontot."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/unverified-account.html:230
msgid ""
"You must verify the primary email address listed below before making any "
"other changes to your account."
msgstr ""
"Du måste verifiera den primära e-postadressen nedan innan du kan göra andra "
"ändringar i kontot."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/unverified-account.html:236
msgid ""
"If you cannot verify the primary email address listed, you can correct it "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Om du inte kan verifiera den angivna primära e-postadressen kan du rätta den"
" nedan."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/unverified-account.html:246
msgid ""
"You must have at least one <span class=\"badge badge--success\"><i "
"class=\"fa fa-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Verified</span> email "
"address to activate your account."
msgstr ""
"Du måste ha minst en <span class=\"badge badge--success\"><i class=\"fa fa-"
"check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> verifierad</span> e-postadress för att "
"kunna aktivera kontot."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/unverified-account.html:268
msgid "Entered the wrong email address?"
msgstr "Angav du fel e-postadress?"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/unverified-account.html:270
msgid ""
"If you made a typo when registering, you can correct your email address "
"below. A new verification email will be sent to the updated address."
msgstr ""
"Om du skrev fel vid registreringen kan du rätta e-postadressen nedan. Ett "
"nytt e-postmeddelande för verifiering skickas till den uppdaterade adressen."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/unverified-account.html:300
msgid "Update email address"
msgstr "Uppdatera e-postadress"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/publishing.html:9
#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/publishing.html:9
#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/publishing.html:16
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Read more about GitHub Actions' OpenID Connect support <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"Läs mer om stödet för OpenID Connect i GitHub Actions <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">här</a>."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/publishing.html:31
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The project that will be created on %(sitename)s when this publisher is used"
msgstr "Projektet som skapas på %(sitename)s när denna utgivare används"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/publishing.html:44
#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/publishing.html:41
#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/publishing.html:37
msgid ""
"The GitHub organization name or GitHub username that owns the repository"
msgstr ""
"Namnet på GitHub-organisationen eller GitHub-användarnamnet som äger "
"förrådet"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/publishing.html:63
#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/publishing.html:60
#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/publishing.html:56
msgid ""
"The name of the GitHub repository that contains the publishing workflow"
msgstr "Namnet på GitHub-förrådet som innehåller publiceringsarbetsflödet"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/publishing.html:69
#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/publishing.html:66
#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/publishing.html:62
msgid "Workflow name"
msgstr "Arbetsflödesnamn"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/publishing.html:74
#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/publishing.html:71
#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/publishing.html:67
msgid "workflow.yml"
msgstr "workflow.yml"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/publishing.html:80
#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/publishing.html:77
#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/publishing.html:73
msgid ""
"The filename of the publishing workflow. This file should exist in the "
"<code>.github/workflows/</code> directory in the repository configured "
"above."
msgstr ""
"Filnamnet för publiceringsarbetsflödet. Filen ska finnas i katalogen "
"<code>.github/workflows/</code> i förrådet som konfigurerats ovan."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/publishing.html:86
#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/publishing.html:185
#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/publishing.html:83
#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/publishing.html:182
#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/publishing.html:79
#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/publishing.html:167
msgid "Environment name"
msgstr "Miljönamn"

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/publishing.html:98
#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/publishing.html:95
#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/publishing.html:92
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The name of the <a href=\"%(href)s\">GitHub Actions environment</a> that the"
" above workflow uses for publishing.  This should be configured under the "
"repository's settings. While not required, a dedicated publishing "
"environment is <strong>strongly</strong> encouraged, "
"<strong>especially</strong> if your repository has maintainers with commit "
"access who shouldn't have PyPI publishing access."
msgstr ""
"Namnet på den <a href=\"%(href)s\">GitHub Actions-miljö</a> som arbetsflödet"
" ovan använder för publicering. Detta ska konfigureras i förrådets "
"inställningar. En särskild publiceringsmiljö krävs inte men rekommenderas "
"<strong>starkt</strong>, <strong>särskilt</strong> om förrådet har "
"underhållare med skrivbehörighet som inte ska kunna publicera till PyPI."

#: warehouse/templates/manage/account/publishing.html:119
#: warehouse/templates/manage/organization/publishing.html:116
#: warehouse/templates/manage/project/publishing.html:114
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Read more about GitLab CI/CD OpenID Connect support <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"Läs mer om stödet för OpenID Connect i GitLab CI/CD <a "
"href=\"%(href)s\">här</a>."
